hadiths[11]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1010","[AI-translation] Umar bin Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Taala tum ko baap dada ki qasam khanay se mana karta hai. Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam! Jab se main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se ye suna main ne baap dada ki qasam nahi khayi hai, na apni taraf se na doosray ki taraf se hikayat kartay hue. (Muslim: 5/80). (Zakiran se murad apni taraf se kehna hai; aasiran se murad ghair se naqal karna hai.)"
"1011","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs qasam khana chahay wo koi qasam na khaye siwae Allah Taala ki qasam ke. Aur Quraish apne baap dada ki qasam khaya kartay thay to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke apne baap dada ki qasam mat khao. (Muslim: 5/81). Baab: Buton ki qasam khanay se mumaniat."
"1012","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Samura (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mat qasam khao buton ki aur na apne baap dadaon ki. (Muslim: 5/82). Baab: Jo Laat aur Uzza ki qasam khaye to La ilaha illallah kahay. (Tawaghi taghiya ki jama hai, but murad hain.)"
"1013","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se apni qasam mein ye kahay ke Laat ki qasam! To usay chahiye ke La ilaha illallah kahay. Aur jo koi kisi doosray se kahay ke aao juwa khelein to wo sadqa karay. Aik riwayat mein Laat ke saath Uzza ka bhi zikr hai. (Muslim: 5/81). Baab: Qasam mein inshaAllah kehna mustahab hai."
"1014","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat kartay hue kehtay hain ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah ke Nabi Sulaiman bin Dawood (alaihissalam) ne kaha ke main aaj raat sattar auraton ke paas jaun ga, aik riwayat mein naway hain, aik mein ninanway aur aik mein sau. Har aik un mein se aik larka janay gi, jo Allah ki raah mein jihad karay ga. Un ke saathi ya farishtay ne kaha ke inshaAllah Taala kaho. Lekin unhon ne nahi kaha, wo bhool gaye. Phir kisi aurat ne bacha na jana siwae aik ke aur wo bhi aadha bacha. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke agar wo inshaAllah kehtay to un ki baat radd na jati aur un ka matlab poora ho jata. (Muslim)."
"1015","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Qasam ka matlab qasam khilanay walay ki niyyat ke muwafiq ho ga. (Muslim: 5/87). Baab: Jo Musalman ka haq apni qasam se kaat le us ke liye aag wajib hai."
"1016","[AI-translation] Abu Umama, yani Harisi, (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs Musalman ka haq, maal ho ya ghair maal jaisay murday ki khaal gobar waghera ya aur qism ke huqooq jaisay haq-e-shufa haq-e-sharb had-e-qazf biwi ke paas rehnay ki baari waghera, qasam kha kar maar le to Allah Taala ne us ke liye jahannam ko wajib kar diya aur us par jannat ko haraam kar diya. Aik shakhs bola Ae Allah ke Rasool! Agar wo zara si cheez ho to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke agarchay peelo ki aik tehni hi ho. (Muslim: 1/85)"
"1017","[AI-translation] Wail bin Hujr (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hazramaut se aik shakhs aur Kinda ka aik shakhs Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaye. Hazramaut walay ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Us shakhs ne meri zameen daba li hai jo mere baap ki thi. Kinda walay ne kaha ke wo meri zameen hai, mere qabzay mein hai, main us mein khaiti karta hun, us ka kuch haq nahi hai. Tab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Hazramaut walay se farmaya ke tere paas gawah hain? Wo bola ke nahi, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke tu phir us se qasam le lo. Wo bola Ae Allah ke Rasool! Wo to fajir hai qasam khanay mein us ko darr nahi aur wo kisi baat ki parwa nahi karta, wo qasam kha sakta hai. Aap ne farmaya ke tumharay liye us se yehi mumkin hai. Jab wo qasam khanay chala, Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne usay jatay hue farmaya: Dekho! Agar us ne doosray ka maal nahaq ura lenay ko qasam khayi to wo Allah se us haal mein milay ga ke Allah Taala us ki taraf se munh pher le ga. (Muslim: 5/86-87). Baab: Jo qasam kha kar phir us se behtar dekhay to kaffara de aur behtar karay."
"1018","[AI-translation] Abu Musa Ashari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas chand Ashariyon ke saath Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se sawaari maangnay ke liye aaya to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Allah ki qasam main tum ko sawaari nahi dun ga aur na mere paas tumhein denay ke liye koi sawaari hai. Phir ham thehray rahay jitni dair ke Allah Taala ne chaha. Us ke baad Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas oont aaye, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne safed kohaan ke teen oont hamein denay ka hukm kiya. Jab ham chalay to ham ne ya baazon ne kaha ke Allah Taala hamein barkat na de ke ham Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaye aur sawaari maangi to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne qasam khayi ke hamein sawaari na milay gi, phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein sawaari di. Phir logon ne aa kar Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se kaha, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke main ne tumhein sawaar nahi kiya lekin Allah Taala ne sawaar kiya aur main to agar Allah chahay to kisi baat ki qasam na khaun ga magar phir us se behtar doosra kaam dekhun ga to apni qasam ka kaffara dun ga aur wo kaam karun ga jo behtar hai. (Muslim: 5/82). (Nastahmiluhu se murad sawaari maangna hai; zoud se murad kohaan walay oont hain.)"
"1019","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aik shakhs ko raat ke waqt Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas dair ho gayi, phir wo apne ghar gaya to bachon ko dekha ke wo so gaye hain. Us ki aurat khana laayi to us ne qasam kha li ke main apne bachon ki wajah se na khaun ga phir us ko khana munasib maloom hua aur us ne kha liya. Baad mein Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se bayan kiya, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke jo shakhs kisi baat ki qasam khaye lekin phir doosri baat us se behtar samjhay to wo karay aur qasam ka kaffara de day. (Muslim: 5/85). Baab: Qasam ke kaffaray ke baaray mein. (Aatama se murad andheri raat mein dakhil hona hai.)"
"1020","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, bayan kartay hain ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Ye ke tum mein se koi apne ghar walon ke baaray mein, nuqsan deh qasam par, israar karay to Allah Taala ke nazdeek us se zyada gunah ki baat hai ke wo kaffara-e-qasam ada kar ke apni qasam tor le, yani usay apni qasam par baaqi rehnay ki bajaye qasam tor kar kaffara-e-qasam ada karna chahiye. (Muslim: 5/88). (Yalajja se murad qasam par israar hai; aasama se murad zyada gunahgar hona hai.)"
